[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=44 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你以为晚上轮到你值班，会有很多需要作决定的事。帕金斯交给你的只有两张表、一个能听两个频道的耳机，和一条不够厚的毯子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="看潮位，记船只进出。接触变化先叫我，别为了不吵醒人，自己试着猜完整。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你不睡近一点？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="我就在隔壁。我睡得不沉，但你别拿这个当可以随便叫我的理由。不是每一次风吹绳子都算敌袭。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把窗边会响的绳扣先固定好，让你听了一遍正常的水泵声。什么属于背景，什么改变了才该注意，她讲得很具体，没有用“凭经验”把你留在原地。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="值班的时候总会想起没做完的事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="可以写在另外一张纸上，不要混进航路记录。你明天回看时得知道，哪一句是外面发生的，哪一句是你脑子里一直在转的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="第一小时里没有船进港。你记下潮位，看到窗台上有一条用尺刻出的细线，下面有人写了一个很小的“先看基准”。你不认识字迹，仍然照着对了一次。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我能进来吗？不是查岗，我来找热水。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="壶在这儿。你怎么也没睡？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="缝手套。缝完一只才发现线不够，想去仓库领，又想明早总得路过，干脆先不缝了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她端着杯坐了一会儿，问你今天最难的是什么。你本来想回答平台的攻击，最后说是那个一直不肯同意的人，因为你不知道做完必要的事以后，能不能还允许他生气。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="能。他的水真停了，他得生气。你只要别因为他没说谢谢，明天就不去修漏的地方。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我怕自己会介意。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我也会介意。我白天给人搬桶，还被说走太慢，差点想把桶放回去。后来想想，桶又没骂我。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你笑出声，帕金斯隔着门咳了一下。德雷顿捂住嘴，等了几秒，没听见别的话，才把杯子轻轻放回桌角。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我们现在这样……真的像一支合格的小队吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="合不合格要看明天还剩多少东西要修。但今天我们把人带回来，水也通了，你没偷偷跟收音机走。我觉得可以睡个觉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她刚端起杯子，门就被人敲了两下。外面站着个推饭车的姑娘，头发用布条绑着，车轮上缠了一大团湿线。她先问这里是不是二号值班室，又看了看门上快掉下来的“一”。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="送饭姑娘"

speaker_name=""

text="我跑了三处。一处说换了，一处没人，最后一处让我跟着管子找。你们明天还在这里吗？我好写在车上，省得每顿都猜。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="白天我不确定。晚班应该还在。你能先放这儿，我等会儿问交班的人，再给你回话吗？这次我记你的名字，不只记送饭来了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="送饭姑娘"

speaker_name=""

text="叫小燕。你别回到食堂的号码，那个晚上没人守。车旁边这个小铃，听见我经过，出来招手就行。我一晚上得走好几趟。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿蹲下去，试着把湿线从轮轴上挑出来。小燕连忙说不用，她却已经弄断一截，用两根手指举起来看了看。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="不是你推得费劲，是它在这儿越卷越厚。谁拿缝帆的线绑饭盒？你等一下，我找个能剪的，别越拉越紧。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这里有刀。帕金斯说它只用来开包装，我剪完会擦干净。饭盒先给我吧，你这只手都勒红了，拎着怎么把线解开。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="小燕把最上面一层饭盒交给你，忽然想起里面有汤，赶紧又伸手托住。你已经拿稳，她的手还是没离开，直到德雷顿说轮子能转了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="送饭姑娘"

speaker_name=""

text="不是不信你。上个月摔过一回，后来每次都要看着人接稳。你要是哪天来帮忙，别觉得我管得多就不来了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我还没帮过这个。可能会问很多次哪一盒放哪儿。你要是不嫌慢，白天没出航的时候，我可以跟一趟，先学会推这辆车。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她认真看了你一眼，说别说“有空就来”，那样她不知道该不该留位置。你翻到表背面，写下明早去问排班，没写自己已经答应了全天。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="先走平路，再碰那个坡。车要往后溜的时候，别用腿挡。我下次路过帮你看一眼刹车，现在只能让这只轮子暂时转起来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="送饭姑娘"

speaker_name=""

text="坡上有人接。问题是他总在等我响铃，我一手扶车一手拎壶，够不着。你们有那种一拉就响的绳吗？不用很新。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你指了指刚被固定好的窗边绳扣，德雷顿立刻摇头。那是用来分辨窗有没有被风掀开的。她从工具袋里翻出一截短绳，穿过铃环，拉了两次。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="试试这个。再长就容易卷到轮子里了，绑在扶手里面。要是还不顺手，拿回来改，别怕我们觉得送出去的东西不好用。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_33"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="小燕把空饭盒叠回车上，又将一盒单独留下。她说这是给没赶上换班的人留的，不一定是谁。德雷顿看了一会儿，问里面有没有葱。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_34"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="送饭姑娘"

speaker_name=""

text="有。你不吃葱就自己挑，别拿“不一定是谁”当它没有主人。真没人来领，天亮以后你再问我，现在可不能先尝。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_35"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="德雷顿把手收回来，装作刚才只是替盒盖抹水。等饭车的铃远了，你才发现窗上的结露已经挡住半边潮尺。你擦开一块，重新对了基准，仍记成这一班自己的数。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_36"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="一艘晚归的小艇在入口亮灯。你核对号码，问清船上人数和是否需要拖带，再打开记录表。一个名字你写错了，对方很平静地纠正，你把旧字划掉，重新写上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_37"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="刚才那艘的回报我听见了。做得对。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_38"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你一直醒着？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_39"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="刚醒。你没有一句话打断三次，所以我听明白了。继续，到点我来接。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_40"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="交班的时候，你把两张纸分开放好。航路记录只有几行，另一张密密写着今天还没想通的问题。帕金斯看了看，说后一张自己拿回去，前一张她会继续写。你终于放下耳机，觉得今晚少了几件必须独自记住的事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

